      "source": [
        "# Porter Delivery Operations Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "## Python Business Analytics Case Study\n",
        "\n",
        "Dataset used: `Porter_Dataset.csv`\n",
        "\n",
        "Goal: analyze delivery performance, SLA breaches, demand patterns, partner availability, delay contributors, and business improvement scenarios.\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook is written in a simple analyst style: clear steps, readable code, and business interpretation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. Business Context\n",
        "\n",
        "Porter wants to improve delivery reliability. Late deliveries can reduce customer satisfaction and create operational pressure.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Business Questions\n",
        "1. What is the typical delivery time?\n",
        "2. How many orders breach 45 and 60 minute SLA limits?\n",
        "3. Which hours, days, markets, protocols, and categories create delays?\n",
        "4. Is partner availability linked with delivery performance?\n",
        "5. Which actions can reduce the largest number of delayed orders?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 2. Import Libraries"
