        "## 5. Data Cleaning and Feature Engineering\n",
        "\n",
        "Cleaning decisions:\n",
        "- Convert timestamps into datetime.\n",
        "- Create delivery duration in minutes.\n",
        "- Create date, hour, day, weekend, and time period features.\n",
        "- Treat `market_id` and `order_protocol` as categories.\n",
        "- Keep missing store category as `Unknown`.\n",
        "- Convert negative partner/order values into missing because they are not realistic.\n",
        "- Add missing flags before imputing partner fields."
      ]
    },
